DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: out of our proposed projects of 179, 30 projects lang po ang nabigyan ng NEP allocation.

asr-000162
00:33:38.130 --> 00:33:54.110
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Ang total proposal po namin for our projects in 2027 is 624 billion but we were only given 237 billion.

asr-000163
00:33:54.110 --> 00:33:59.310
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So ito po ay na-distribute among railways project.

asr-000164
00:33:59.790 --> 00:34:03.230
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Ang proposed po namin is 22 projects.

asr-000165
00:34:03.650 --> 00:34:10.410
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So balit ang naibigay lang po sa amin ay 6 na projects worth 194 billion.

asr-000166
00:34:11.270 --> 00:34:17.730
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa road transport naman po nag-propose po kami ng 19 projects worth 37 billion.

asr-000167
00:34:17.730 --> 00:34:24.030
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Pero ang naibigay lang po sa amin ay 7 projects na worth 15 billion.

asr-000168
00:34:24.110 --> 00:34:31.610
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa aviation po, 42 projects worth 23 billion.

asr-000169
00:34:32.170 --> 00:34:38.770
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Pero ang naibigay lang po sa amin ay 10 projects worth 5.8 billion.

asr-000170
00:34:39.610 --> 00:34:44.310
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa maritime po, 94 po yung aming proposal.

asr-000171
00:34:45.170 --> 00:34:52.330
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So balit ang naibigay lang po sa amin ay 5 projects worth 18.1 billion.

asr-000172
00:34:52.730 --> 00:34:53.830
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Ito pong

asr-000176
00:34:54.110 --> 00:34:56.330
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: IPIF and FAST-INFRA.

asr-000177
00:34:56.850 --> 00:35:00.410
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Dalawa po ito sa nabigyan din po namin ng DBM.

asr-000178
00:35:01.890 --> 00:35:04.990
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Kung titignan po natin ang detalye,

asr-000179
00:35:05.570 --> 00:35:15.090
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: sa rail project po, yung pre-propose po namin 7 projects for foreign assisted projects.

asr-000180
00:35:15.230 --> 00:35:17.490
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Apat lang po ang nabigyan ng DBM.

asr-000181
00:35:17.490 --> 00:35:21.050
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So ito po yung LRT Line 1 Cavite Extension,

asr-000182
00:35:21.750 --> 00:35:23.490
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: the Metro Manila Subway,

asr-000183
00:35:23.490 --> 00:35:29.450
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: the MRT Line 3 Rehab Project at the North-South Commuter Railway System.

asr-000184
00:35:30.030 --> 00:35:35.710
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So ito po yung nabigyan nila out of the 7 projects na amin pong iprinopose.

asr-000185
00:35:36.070 --> 00:35:38.830
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Hindi po nabigyan yung sa Mindanao Railway,

asr-000186
00:35:39.270 --> 00:35:43.550
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: MRT Line 4 at sa PNR South Long Haul Project.

asr-000187
00:35:44.790 --> 00:35:48.490
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa railway sector pa rin po, locally funded projects,

asr-000188
00:35:49.290 --> 00:35:52.330
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: ang prinopose po namin ay 13 projects.

asr-000189
00:35:52.330 --> 00:35:53.310
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So balit,

asr-000190
00:35:53.310 --> 00:35:55.930
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: dalawa lang po ang binigay ng DBM.

asr-000191
00:35:56.770 --> 00:36:03.270
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So yung aming pong mga locally projects for railway as enumerated in our presentation,

asr-000192
00:36:04.090 --> 00:36:06.010
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: hindi po naibigay ng DBM.

asr-000193
00:36:06.470 --> 00:36:09.790
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Totaling to 97.9 billion.

asr-000194
00:36:11.490 --> 00:36:13.230
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa road transport po,

asr-000195
00:36:13.430 --> 00:36:17.310
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: ang prinopose po namin for foreign assisted ay dalawa.

asr-000196
00:36:17.310 --> 00:36:21.630
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Luckily po, nabigyan naman po ng allocation sa NEP

asr-000197
00:36:21.630 --> 00:36:23.310
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: yung dalawang foreign assisted projects.

asr-000198
00:36:23.310 --> 00:36:27.270
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So balit, kung titignan po yung amount,

asr-000199
00:36:27.730 --> 00:36:30.750
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: ang aming pong proposal was 19 billion,

asr-000200
00:36:31.310 --> 00:36:36.250
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: pero ang ibinigay lang po nila ay 15 billion, worth 15 billion.

asr-000201
00:36:36.750 --> 00:36:43.310
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So may kakulangan pong 4.7 billion compared to our proposed requirement.

asr-000202
00:36:44.410 --> 00:36:47.310
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: On the locally funded projects for road transport,

asr-000203
00:36:48.430 --> 00:36:51.470
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: ang proposal po namin ay labing pitong project.

asr-000208
00:36:53.310 --> 00:36:56.610
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So balit, binigyan lang po kami ng allocation for 5 projects

asr-000209
00:36:56.610 --> 00:37:00.870
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: na nandito po, nakalista po sa aming presentation.

asr-000210
00:37:02.270 --> 00:37:04.490
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Ngayon din po, yung mga projects po,

asr-000211
00:37:04.610 --> 00:37:09.430
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: totaling 12 items na hindi po nabigyan ng DBM ng allocation.

asr-000212
00:37:09.990 --> 00:37:14.890
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Ang total amount po ay 12,979,000.

asr-000213
00:37:15.330 --> 00:37:16.530
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Hindi po nabigyan.

asr-000214
00:37:17.390 --> 00:37:19.130
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa aviation sector po,

asr-000215
00:37:19.130 --> 00:37:23.290
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: sa foreign assisted po, medyo maswerte din po kami.

asr-000216
00:37:23.310 --> 00:37:27.030
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa pagkat yung dalawang proposal po namin for foreign assisted

asr-000217
00:37:27.030 --> 00:37:29.570
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: ay naibigay naman po ng DBM.

asr-000218
00:37:30.110 --> 00:37:32.470
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So balit, kung titignan po yung amount,

asr-000219
00:37:33.110 --> 00:37:38.310
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: again, ang proposal po namin was 3.8 billion for foreign assisted projects.

asr-000220
00:37:39.390 --> 00:37:44.130
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Ang naibigay lang po sa amin is halos kalahati, 1.9 billion.

asr-000221
00:37:44.910 --> 00:37:50.630
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So makikita po natin na medyo kulang pa rin po

asr-000222
00:37:50.630 --> 00:37:53.190
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: than the requirement yung naibigay ng DBM.

asr-000223
00:37:53.310 --> 00:37:57.110
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa aviation sector na locally funded projects,

asr-000224
00:37:57.250 --> 00:38:01.390
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: ang aming pong proposal is 40 projects for zero.

asr-000225
00:38:01.970 --> 00:38:06.130
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Ang naibigay lang po nila ay para sa walong proyekto.

asr-000226
00:38:06.670 --> 00:38:14.550
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Totaling 3.9 billion out of our total proposal of 19.30 billion.

asr-000227
00:38:15.250 --> 00:38:17.930
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So makikita po din sa aming presentation,

asr-000228
00:38:18.270 --> 00:38:21.770
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: yung list po ng mga hindi nabigyan ng DBM

asr-000229
00:38:22.030 --> 00:38:23.110
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: out of our total proposal of 19.30 billion.

asr-000230
00:38:23.110 --> 00:38:24.950
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So that's the total of our submitted proposal.

asr-000231
00:38:26.090 --> 00:38:29.350
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa maritime po, sa foreign assisted projects,

asr-000232
00:38:29.910 --> 00:38:32.690
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: medyo maganda rin po in terms of ano,

asr-000233
00:38:32.830 --> 00:38:37.430
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: because yung apat na projects na pinopost po namin

asr-000234
00:38:37.430 --> 00:38:39.710
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: ay naibigay din po ng DBM.

asr-000235
00:38:40.050 --> 00:38:42.370
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So balit, looking at the amount,

asr-000236
00:38:42.770 --> 00:38:46.410
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: our total proposal is 22.7 billion,

asr-000237
00:38:46.850 --> 00:38:50.630
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: but we were only given 18.13 billion.

asr-000238
00:38:50.950 --> 00:38:53.050
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Sa locally funded projects,

asr-000239
00:38:53.110 --> 00:38:57.190
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: po ng maritime, medyo malungkot po ang sitwasyon

asr-000240
00:38:57.190 --> 00:39:01.230
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: because out of the 91 projects we have proposed,

asr-000241
00:39:01.710 --> 00:39:03.890
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: isa lang po ang binigay ng DBM.

asr-000242
00:39:04.490 --> 00:39:08.270
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: At yun po yung aming, what's this,

asr-000243
00:39:09.230 --> 00:39:11.630
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: lump sum amount para po sa maritime.

asr-000244
00:39:11.950 --> 00:39:15.290
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So mga projects po, 90 items po,

asr-000245
00:39:15.430 --> 00:39:18.010
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: yung hindi nila nabigyan ng alokasyon.

asr-000246
00:39:18.450 --> 00:39:21.010
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So nakalista rin po yung mga projects

asr-000247
00:39:21.530 --> 00:39:23.010
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: na hindi po nabigyan ng alokasyon.

asr-000248
00:39:23.110 --> 00:39:35.340
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So ito po yung ano namin sa IPIF at saka sa FAST-INPRA.

asr-000249
00:39:36.260 --> 00:39:40.080
