asr-000252
00:39:48.760 --> 00:39:53.560
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So balit, ang naibigay lang po sa amin is 2.79 billion.

asr-000253
00:39:53.560 --> 00:39:54.660
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So,

asr-000254
00:39:55.960 --> 00:39:59.060
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: pero yung pong 2.79 billion na yun

