00:39:59.060 --> 00:40:00.920
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: is not even enough

asr-000256
00:40:00.920 --> 00:40:04.920
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: for the requirement of the NSCR projects.

asr-000257
00:40:05.480 --> 00:40:07.300
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So yung mga ibang items po

asr-000258
00:40:07.300 --> 00:40:08.900
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: is talaga pong medyo

asr-000259
00:40:08.900 --> 00:40:12.300
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: hindi po namin, hindi po nabigyan ng alokasyon

asr-000260
00:40:12.300 --> 00:40:15.280
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: on the ROW requirements.

asr-000261
00:40:16.580 --> 00:40:16.780
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So,

asr-000262
00:40:17.100 --> 00:40:19.200
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: eto naman po, just to end,

asr-000263
00:40:19.420 --> 00:40:21.020
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: just to complete the picture,

asr-000264
00:40:21.560 --> 00:40:24.840
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: ito po yung budgetary support to government corporations

asr-000265
00:40:24.840 --> 00:40:25.940
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: na ibinigay po sa IPIF.

asr-000266
00:40:25.960 --> 00:40:29.760
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: So, para po sa LRTA at sa PNR,

asr-000267
00:40:29.900 --> 00:40:33.280
