asr-000268
00:40:33.660 --> 00:40:36.560
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: totaling 1.2 billion po.

asr-000269
00:40:38.140 --> 00:40:39.400
DOTr Assistant Secretary Cecilia E. Bien: Marami pong salamat.

