DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Ito po yung nakatakdang magbukas at mag-umpisa ng

asr-001789
01:51:35.150 --> 01:51:40.470
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: passenger operations ng December of 2027 po. So yung una po

asr-001790
01:51:40.470 --> 01:51:45.950
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: nating segment, yun po ang ating status. Yun pong ating sunod

asr-001791
01:51:46.610 --> 01:51:52.610
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: po na 53 kilometers ay nasa 85% na po ang ating right-of-way

asr-001792
01:51:52.610 --> 01:51:57.010
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: acquisition. Ongoing po ang ating construction doon.

asr-001793
01:51:57.010 --> 01:52:01.210
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Tina-target po natin na mag-umpisang tumakbo ang mga tren

asr-001794
01:52:01.210 --> 01:52:02.650
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: doon ng 2028.

asr-001795
01:52:02.690 --> 01:52:07.070
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ilan ang area ng bawat station? Mga ilang square meters?

asr-001796
01:52:07.870 --> 01:52:12.670
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Ang isang station po is roughly 10,000 square meters per station.

asr-001797
01:52:12.670 --> 01:52:13.950
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ikaw yung area? Bawat station?

asr-001798
01:52:14.250 --> 01:52:14.470
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Apo.

asr-001799
01:52:15.750 --> 01:52:20.130
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: And yung huli po nating segment doon po sa south, papunta pong

asr-001800
01:52:20.130 --> 01:52:24.710
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Calamba ay nasa 64% na po ang ating right-of-way acquisition.

asr-001801
01:52:24.710 --> 01:52:29.370
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: At lahat po nito ay ongoing construction at nakamobilize po

asr-001802
01:52:29.370 --> 01:52:30.570
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: ang ating mga contractors.

asr-001803
01:52:31.550 --> 01:52:34.790
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ito bang right-of-way na ito? Kasama doon sa P150 billion?

asr-001804
01:52:34.930 --> 01:52:36.770
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Separate fund ba ito sa right-of-way?

asr-001805
01:52:37.910 --> 01:52:42.790
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Yung pondo po natin para sa right-of-way acquisition ng NSCR,

asr-001806
01:52:43.030 --> 01:52:48.810
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: meron po ditong nanggagaling doon sa GOP component po nung ating

asr-001807
01:52:48.810 --> 01:52:54.690
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: NSCR na line item. At gumagamit din po tayo nung right-of-way

asr-001808
01:52:54.710 --> 01:52:58.730
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: line item ng DOTR po. Doon po nanggagaling yung ating budget.

asr-001809
01:53:00.050 --> 01:53:04.230
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Tungkol po doon sa, natanong ko na rin po ito during last hearing,

asr-001810
01:53:04.990 --> 01:53:07.090
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: hindi pa si Secretary Lopez pa noon.

asr-001811
01:53:07.470 --> 01:53:14.490
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Meron po kayo kasing binabanggit doon ni Yosef Sir Chavez na meron

asr-001812
01:53:14.490 --> 01:53:18.450
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: $5 million na grant para sa feasibility studies po nito.

asr-001813
01:53:18.810 --> 01:53:23.070
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kumusta po? Nagamit ba natin po yung $5 million for feasibility studies?

asr-001814
01:53:28.350 --> 01:53:29.170
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Mr. Chair, maraming salamat.

asr-001815
01:53:29.190 --> 01:53:34.310
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Dahil po yung $5 million na feasibility studies po,

asr-001816
01:53:34.850 --> 01:53:41.190
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: baka po hindi siya yung grant. Baka po ang pinagtutunan po ay yung

asr-001817
01:53:41.190 --> 01:53:48.990
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: project development po na facility ng DOTR with the Asian Development Bank.

asr-001818
01:53:49.650 --> 01:53:54.770
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: Yan po ay ginagamit natin at kasalukuyan pong umuusad yung iba't ibang

asr-001819
01:53:54.770 --> 01:53:59.170
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: mga master plan at feasibility studies po kasama po ng ating grant.

asr-001820
01:53:59.190 --> 01:54:03.910
DOTr Undersecretary Timothy John Batan: At yung ating planning department po, umuusad naman po yung mga feasibility studies na yan.

asr-001821
01:54:04.130 --> 01:54:05.630
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Na-approve na ba yung feasibility studies?

asr-001822
01:54:06.010 --> 01:54:09.410
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Pwede ko tanongin na lang yung in-charge sa road components, yung road infrastructure,

asr-001823
01:54:09.650 --> 01:54:11.810
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: yung senior Yosef Pastor.

asr-001824
01:54:12.550 --> 01:54:15.710
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Tungkol doon sa nabanggit po kanina, $3.8 million na lang po yun.

asr-001825
01:54:16.210 --> 01:54:19.530
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Tapos na ba yung feasibility studies? Kasi interesado kami sa Bulacan.

asr-001826
01:54:20.130 --> 01:54:23.590
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Maraming nakikinig po sa buong Bulacan ngayon. Millions na tao nakikinig.

asr-001827
01:54:23.670 --> 01:54:25.370
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: At alam nila magsasalita po ako rito.

asr-001828
01:54:25.370 --> 01:54:28.810
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: At matutuwan to sila sa mga pangako nating Pangulo.

asr-001829
01:54:29.190 --> 01:54:40.310
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Partially, ma-open 2027, 2028, yung Valenzuela up to Malolos, Malolos to Clark ng 2028.

asr-001830
01:54:40.510 --> 01:54:43.830
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kaya napakalaki. Millions ang magkikinabanggit po ito.

asr-001831
01:54:44.270 --> 01:54:47.390
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Hindi lang Central Luzon, Northern Luzon, pati po mga taga-Bisayas, Mindanao.

asr-001832
01:54:47.510 --> 01:54:50.930
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kasi pupunta ng Metro Manila, ang gusto ko sa Southern Tagalog, Laguna.

asr-001833
01:54:51.430 --> 01:54:54.710
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Magkikinabanggit po ito dito sa ginagawin natin na rails.

asr-001834
01:54:55.370 --> 01:54:56.970
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Cong Pleyto, please wrap up.

asr-001835
01:54:57.690 --> 01:54:58.910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, if I may.

asr-001836
01:54:59.190 --> 01:55:05.550
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: As to the grant po, Your Honor, we beg your indulgence po.

asr-001837
01:55:05.690 --> 01:55:09.290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Titignan namin kung saan yung grant na yun for the road component.

asr-001838
01:55:09.750 --> 01:55:14.830
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Be that as it may po, Your Honor, titignan na rin namin ngayon ang pamamaraan

asr-001839
01:55:14.830 --> 01:55:17.970
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: kapag may makakasama din namin sa current budget namin.

asr-001840
01:55:18.090 --> 01:55:21.710
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At least for the feasible na sinasabi po ng iyong road component

asr-001841
01:55:21.710 --> 01:55:25.450
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: para masimulan na po namin whether or not may grant po

asr-001842
01:55:25.450 --> 01:55:28.910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na sa tingin namin pwede namin pakuhanan ng budget po.

asr-001843
01:55:29.190 --> 01:55:31.970
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ibigyan po namin ang priority, Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

asr-001844
01:55:32.310 --> 01:55:33.090
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-001845
01:55:33.210 --> 01:55:35.590
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Mr. Chair, mga 30 seconds pa po ako, di ba?

asr-001846
01:55:36.810 --> 01:55:37.830
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Actually, wala na po.

asr-001847
01:55:37.990 --> 01:55:38.510
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Wala na po.

asr-001848
01:55:39.150 --> 01:55:40.430
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: May 30 seconds pa.

asr-001849
01:55:40.510 --> 01:55:42.110
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Pero you have the last question.

asr-001850
01:55:42.410 --> 01:55:43.190
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Isa na lang, isa na lang.

asr-001851
01:55:43.390 --> 01:55:44.550
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001852
01:55:47.030 --> 01:55:51.010
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kasi po yung nakiusap po kayo, Secretary, alam nyo, action man po ito,

asr-001853
01:55:51.390 --> 01:55:53.190
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: isa sa iyong mga staff, trusted staff.

asr-001854
01:55:53.190 --> 01:55:58.270
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Pag-itignan lang po yung Santa Maria, highest population na po kami sa buong Bulacan,

asr-001855
01:55:58.410 --> 01:55:59.170
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: yung aking bayan.

asr-001856
01:55:59.190 --> 01:56:04.050
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Mga 300,000 na population na po kami doon.

asr-001857
01:56:04.750 --> 01:56:10.890
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Itong tatlong apat na legislative district, magkikinabang lahat po kasi dito.

asr-001858
01:56:11.350 --> 01:56:15.190
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kaya pagkipasalan lang yung national roads,

asr-001859
01:56:15.430 --> 01:56:18.870
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: manggagaling ng Pukawi-Santa Maria papunta sa Norsagaray.

asr-001860
01:56:19.330 --> 01:56:21.850
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Hindi na po gumagalaw talaga pag nakita nyo doon.

asr-001861
01:56:22.390 --> 01:56:25.930
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Hindi lang kami nagreklamo kasi alam po na marami kayong mga ginagawa.

asr-001862
01:56:25.930 --> 01:56:29.050
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: At yung mga pangulo, napakaraming priority projects.

asr-001863
01:56:29.190 --> 01:56:29.630
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ang ginagawa.

asr-001864
01:56:30.010 --> 01:56:38.470
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Pakitignan lang po at kung pwedeng mapasyalan para matulungan lang po kami paano mga remedial measures

asr-001865
01:56:38.470 --> 01:56:42.250
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: para lumuwag ang traffic sa District 6 po.

asr-001866
01:56:42.670 --> 01:56:43.690
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Sir.

asr-001867
01:56:44.590 --> 01:56:46.590
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-001868
01:56:46.690 --> 01:56:51.350
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Gagawin po namin at yun nga po, at least for the MRT-7, yung road component

asr-001869
01:56:51.350 --> 01:56:57.350
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: at kung kailangan po namin na ang ipag-ugnayan po kay Secretary Vince also sa DPWH

asr-001870
01:56:57.350 --> 01:56:58.910
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: para at least mabigyan po namin.

asr-001871
01:56:58.910 --> 01:57:03.410
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At mabigyan po namin ng tamang connectivity at mobility po yung mga constituents, Mr. Chair.

asr-001872
01:57:03.750 --> 01:57:12.910
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair, Secretary Lopez, sa mga sagot nyo, sa mga tugon, sa aking mga tanong.

asr-001873
01:57:13.630 --> 01:57:22.170
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: At binibigay po ito in my own representation, ang aking lubos na suporta sa panupalang budget ng DOTR.

asr-001874
01:57:22.170 --> 01:57:26.190
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: At kung po pwede, Mr. Chair, itagal natin kasi nakita ko panaykulang lahat.

asr-001875
01:57:26.290 --> 01:57:26.790
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Lahat ang sila.

asr-001876
01:57:27.190 --> 01:57:28.470
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kanina sa very comprehensive.

asr-001877
01:57:28.910 --> 01:57:33.610
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: So, presentation, panay, mabawasan lahat ang mga kanilang mga nangailangan.

asr-001878
01:57:33.770 --> 01:57:38.370
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kaya po, kung pwede, Mr. Chair, matulungan natin na madagdagan ang kanilang budget.

asr-001879
01:57:38.470 --> 01:57:39.170
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001880
01:57:41.510 --> 01:57:43.450
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Thank you, Congressman Pleyto.

asr-001881
01:57:43.790 --> 01:57:49.650
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: You are allowed to extend dahil po sa masarap na supply ng chicharon at fish crackers kahapon.

asr-001882
01:57:50.330 --> 01:57:51.230
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001883
01:57:53.790 --> 01:57:58.890
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Before we proceed, the Chair would like to acknowledge Representative Jeffrey Ferrer,

asr-001884
01:57:58.910 --> 01:58:16.870
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: and Representative Renee Louise Co, and the Civil Society Organization represented by Ms. Isabel Eugene Agregado of Move As One Coalition.

asr-001885
01:58:17.730 --> 01:58:18.110
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you.

asr-001886
01:58:18.730 --> 01:58:23.370
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Next is Cong Dada.

asr-001887
01:58:23.790 --> 01:58:26.150
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-001888
01:58:26.370 --> 01:58:28.370
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuh.

asr-001889
01:58:28.910 --> 01:58:36.450
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa ating DOTR and to its attached agencies, magandang umaga po sa ating lahat.

asr-001890
01:58:36.930 --> 01:58:44.210
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, during the DBCC briefing and in my earlier questions sa DPWH,

asr-001891
01:58:44.850 --> 01:58:53.990
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I already raised concerns on foreign-assisted projects, particularly on delays, penalties, and the risk of losing commitment fees.

asr-001892
01:58:53.990 --> 01:58:58.890
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngayon po, I want to extend the same line of accountability to the Department of...

asr-001893
01:58:58.910 --> 01:58:59.750
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Transportation.

asr-001894
01:59:00.690 --> 01:59:08.770
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilan lahat po at anong type ang mga foreign-assisted projects na ipapatupad ng DOTR this coming 2027?

asr-001895
01:59:11.350 --> 01:59:19.310
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: On top of my mind po, per sector po, gawin natin rail, we have two, NSCR and subway.

asr-001896
01:59:20.110 --> 01:59:22.590
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sa road sector natin, we have Davao.

asr-001897
01:59:23.630 --> 01:59:28.990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And matatapos na po yung Cebu BRT, sa World Bank.

asr-001898
01:59:28.990 --> 01:59:30.150
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sa maritime.

asr-001899
01:59:30.290 --> 01:59:31.110
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I think we have one.

asr-001900
01:59:31.450 --> 01:59:34.230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Cebu with Kexim Bank.

asr-001901
01:59:34.990 --> 01:59:37.170
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And with Aviation.

asr-001902
01:59:37.650 --> 01:59:39.370
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Meron kami tayong NUD Dumaguete.

asr-001903
01:59:39.850 --> 01:59:41.670
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So more or less po mga anim po.

asr-001904
01:59:41.930 --> 01:59:43.150
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: I might be wrong pero...

asr-001905
01:59:43.150 --> 01:59:43.690
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Six to seven.

asr-001906
01:59:43.970 --> 01:59:44.190
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Apo.

asr-001907
01:59:44.390 --> 01:59:44.630
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes.

asr-001908
01:59:44.930 --> 01:59:57.590
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can you confirm also to this committee, no, Mr. Chair, that there are commitment fees paid by the taxpayers in this foreign-assisted projects na pwedeng mawala if hindi matuloy ang projects?

asr-001909
01:59:59.430 --> 01:59:59.990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama.

asr-001910
02:00:00.000 --> 02:00:06.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Apo, we confirm po, the commitment fees is always part of the contract negotiation and the contract loan itself.

asr-001911
02:00:07.780 --> 02:00:16.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Between 2022 to present, ilan na po kaya ang projects that were placed under unprogrammed appropriations

asr-001912
02:00:16.100 --> 02:00:21.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: and ang delayed na ang implementation or na-delay na ang implementations?

asr-001913
02:00:21.700 --> 02:00:23.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano-ano po kaya yung mga projects na ito?

asr-001914
02:00:23.800 --> 02:00:30.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Insofar as DOTR po is concerned, lahat po halos ng loan proceeds namin,

asr-001915
02:00:30.860 --> 02:00:35.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: meron po siyang unprogrammed appropriation na component po.

asr-001916
02:00:35.840 --> 02:00:39.840
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi po yung sa laki po ng ating foreign assisted project,

asr-001917
02:00:40.140 --> 02:00:46.560
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: mahirapan po talaga ang ating budget naman, ang ating pondo na gagawin programmed appropriation.

asr-001918
02:00:46.560 --> 02:00:51.740
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang nangyari lang po noong manakaraang kongreso,

asr-001919
02:00:51.740 --> 02:01:00.480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ay wala na po ang nailagay sa program amount, nailagay pala halos lahat sa unprogrammed appropriation.

asr-001920
02:01:00.980 --> 02:01:06.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At itong unprogrammed appropriation, nasama pa yung mga iba't ibang proyekto.

asr-001921
02:01:06.620 --> 02:01:12.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya po ang nangyari, imbes bigyan prioridad yung mga foreign assisted project natin,

asr-001922
02:01:12.440 --> 02:01:17.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: hindi po nabigyan ng ganoong priority at kaya po medyo napahaba,

asr-001923
02:01:17.100 --> 02:01:21.660
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na antala ang pagpapatupad ng proyekto at nagkaroon po,

asr-001924
02:01:21.740 --> 02:01:25.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ng mga sa malaking financing charges, suspension of works.

asr-001925
02:01:25.540 --> 02:01:30.180
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung yun po yung, I think that's the line of questioning po, Your Honor.

asr-001926
02:01:30.540 --> 02:01:35.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, Mr. Chair. Actually, figures lang po, Mr. Chair, gusto ko lang malaman,

asr-001927
02:01:35.560 --> 02:01:43.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ilan yung napuntang unprogrammed appropriations natin na projects mula 2022 to present po?

asr-001928
02:01:46.020 --> 02:01:52.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, may I beg the kindness indulgence of Congressman Dada.

asr-001929
02:01:52.140 --> 02:01:54.120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Can we just submit po?

asr-001930
02:01:54.140 --> 02:02:00.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Para at least mas exact po yung numerong ibibigay namin, kasi importante po yung iyong katanungan.

asr-001931
02:02:00.640 --> 02:02:02.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Hopefully, within the day, we can submit po.

asr-001932
02:02:02.780 --> 02:02:08.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes. Maraming salamat and I am amenable po doon na you can submit that later.

asr-001933
02:02:09.000 --> 02:02:12.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ayon sa COA noong 2024, ang DOTR naman daw po,

asr-001934
02:02:12.960 --> 02:02:19.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang may pinakamalaking binayaran na commitment fees at around 308 million pesos.

asr-001935
02:02:19.480 --> 02:02:24.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Magkano naman po ang binayad nating commitment fees nitong 2025?

asr-001936
02:02:24.140 --> 02:02:37.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Again, Mr. Chair, when it comes to commitment fees po, the one paying is actually DOF po.

asr-001937
02:02:37.700 --> 02:02:49.000
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So, let us coordinate with DOF. We'll ask them po kung magkano ba yung binayaran ng DOF ng commitment fees for on behalf of DOTR po.

asr-001938
02:02:49.120 --> 02:02:50.860
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Then we'll get back po to the committee.

asr-001939
02:02:50.860 --> 02:02:58.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, Mr. Chair. Actually, kaya ko ito na brought up dito at tinanong kasi kinonfirm po ng DOF during their budget,

asr-001940
02:02:58.200 --> 02:03:06.700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: hearing na meron silang around 3.4 billion pesos na binayaran from 2022 to present.

asr-001941
02:03:06.700 --> 02:03:17.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And with that, na-inform din ng DOF na ito'y sumatotal ng mga commitment fees ng under DPWH and DOTR.

asr-001942
02:03:18.300 --> 02:03:28.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Noong nagkaroon ng DPWH budget hearing last week, naitanong na natin ito kay Secretary Vins, Mr. Chair, at around 1.6 billion ang sinabi niya.

asr-001943
02:03:28.200 --> 02:03:35.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya po ngayon, the same courtesy, tinatanong ko rin po sa DOTR, magkano naman po ang commitment fees under the DOTR?

asr-001944
02:03:40.970 --> 02:03:47.810
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po, Mr. Chair. Just maybe later po, pinapatawagan ko na po yung ano kung to coordinate with DOF.

asr-001945
02:03:47.930 --> 02:03:53.230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: How much is the commitment fees paid by DOF for on behalf of DOTR projects po?

asr-001946
02:03:53.490 --> 02:04:00.150
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sige po. For later na lang din po, to be submitted to the committee and to this representation po.

asr-001947
02:04:00.150 --> 02:04:02.430
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, I would like to manifest.

asr-001948
02:04:02.490 --> 02:04:12.430
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa tindi ng traffic ngayon, malaking ginhawa sana sa commuters ang Metro Manila Subway Projects, EDSA Busway, Cebu Bus Rapid Transit,

asr-001949
02:04:12.830 --> 02:04:17.750
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero nadidelay or nakakancel lang dahil nababagsak sa unprogrammed appropriations.

asr-001950
02:04:18.290 --> 02:04:26.510
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kumbaga, ang mga taxpayers natin, naipit na nga sa traffic, nagmumulta pa ng commitment fees mula sa taxes natin.

asr-001951
02:04:26.510 --> 02:04:32.470
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I would like to formally request the DOTR through this committee to provide the complete data,

asr-001952
02:04:32.490 --> 02:04:38.450
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: relevant to these questions, including projects list, timeline, and financial details.

asr-001953
02:04:38.710 --> 02:04:41.990
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana po ay ma-provide ito within the day or within the week.

asr-001954
02:04:42.290 --> 02:04:43.690
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Katanggap naman.

asr-001955
02:04:44.290 --> 02:04:48.590
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mapunta naman po ako, Mr. Chair, sa Zamboanga Port Construction.

asr-001956
02:04:49.350 --> 02:04:58.910
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maalala po natin na last year, tinerminate po ng Philippine Ports Authority ang contract with MAC Builders, Inc.

asr-001957
02:04:58.910 --> 02:05:02.470
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: for the construction of the Zamboanga Port passenger

asr-001958
02:05:02.490 --> 02:05:06.610
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: terminal building due to the prolonged delays.

asr-001959
02:05:06.830 --> 02:05:15.410
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Napenalize na po ba natin ang Mack Builders INC dahil sa delay sa completion of the project,

asr-001960
02:05:15.750 --> 02:05:20.290
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: which ultimately lead to the termination of the contract with them?

asr-001961
02:05:24.190 --> 02:05:26.990
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Mr. Chair, may I defer to the general manager of PPA, please?

asr-001962
02:05:28.270 --> 02:05:30.410
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair. Good morning po.

asr-001963
02:05:30.530 --> 02:05:31.930
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: With the permission of our Secretary.

asr-001964
02:05:32.810 --> 02:05:35.330
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: In response po dun sa tanong ni Congresswoman,

asr-001965
02:05:35.330 --> 02:05:42.730
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yun po ng passenger terminal building po natin, tama po dahil nga po sa delay po no, noong completion yan,

asr-001966
02:05:43.290 --> 02:05:50.550
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: inerminate na po natin yung kontrata po noong kontratista at ang nangyari po dyan,

asr-001967
02:05:50.690 --> 02:05:56.830
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: ang kanila pong after assessment, ang computation po ng kanilang accomplishment is about 52%

asr-001968
02:05:56.830 --> 02:06:02.650
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: pero ang nabayaran pa lamang po natin is 18% at hindi na po tayo nagbayad.

asr-001969
02:06:02.650 --> 02:06:09.650
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Yung pong balance pa po doon sa 52% at wala po tayong planong bayaran po,

asr-001970
02:06:10.310 --> 02:06:16.610
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: your honor, yung natitira po between 80, yung pong difference pa po ng accomplishment nila sa nabayaran na po.

asr-001971
02:06:16.970 --> 02:06:24.090
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Kasa lukuyan po, ini-schedule po natin ang rebuilding noong passenger terminal building po natin

asr-001972
02:06:24.090 --> 02:06:32.270
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: at dahil nga po sa nangyari po sa gitnang silangan, your honors, na tumaas po ang presyo po ng crudo,

asr-001973
02:06:32.650 --> 02:06:39.370
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: na obliga po tayong mag-adjust po ng costo po natin doon sa mga materyalis po pati po doon sa project,

asr-001974
02:06:39.530 --> 02:06:45.630
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: kaya po medyo natagalan po tayong konti pero inaasahan po natin na hindi po matatapos po itong taon

asr-001975
02:06:45.630 --> 02:06:51.750
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: ay ma-re-rebeat po natin at ma-iaward at mapapatuloy na po natin yung pong completion po

asr-001976
02:06:51.750 --> 02:06:56.410
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: noong passenger terminal building po natin sa Zamboanga City Port, your honor.

asr-001977
02:06:58.470 --> 02:07:00.130
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, salamat po.

asr-001978
02:07:00.130 --> 02:07:03.850
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Given na ang Zamboanga ay isa sa pinaka-busy,

asr-001979
02:07:04.030 --> 02:07:09.570
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na port sa Pilipinas, can you give an update on this project kung matutuloy pa ba?

asr-001980
02:07:10.750 --> 02:07:19.970
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I understand na sinabi mo magkakaroon ng re-beading pero ano po yung kongkretong plano ninyo, timeline, road map?

asr-001981
02:07:20.890 --> 02:07:26.530
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Well, ang inaasahan po natin, your honor, is ngayon taon po, ayan po ay ma-re-rebeat,

asr-001982
02:07:26.530 --> 02:07:33.270
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: ma-iaward at masisimulan po ang re-implementation po noong ating passenger terminal building project.

asr-001983
02:07:33.270 --> 02:07:38.710
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: Hindi po natin maaaring abandonahin yan dahil yan po ay nasa kalagitnaan po ng ating construction

asr-001984
02:07:38.710 --> 02:07:45.050
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: at inaasahan po natin na bago po bumaba sa ating pong Pangulo sa 2028,

asr-001985
02:07:45.170 --> 02:07:51.590
PPA General Manager Jay Daniel R. Santiago: yan po ay nagagamit na po ng mga kababayan po natin sa Zamboanga pati na rin po sa Basilan at Sulu po, your honor.

asr-001986
02:07:52.430 --> 02:07:54.470
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat with that, Mr. Chair.

asr-001987
02:07:54.910 --> 02:08:01.930
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Finally, dadako po naman ako sa mga tanong tungkol sa maritime safety naman po.

asr-001988
02:08:01.930 --> 02:08:17.810
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: But before that, I would like to commend Rear Admiral Atty. Oliver Tanseco, Inspector General of the PCG for conducting a thorough and swift investigation regarding the M/V Trisha Kerstin 3 incident.

asr-001989
02:08:18.550 --> 02:08:23.390
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And for ensuring accountability among the officers involved. Maraming salamat po.

asr-001990
02:08:23.390 --> 02:08:30.370
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Gayun pa man, nais ko pong i-emphasize na ang insidente ay nagsisilbing paalala at aral,

asr-001991
02:08:31.930 --> 02:08:37.310
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng mga opisyal na tiyakin ang preventive measures upang maiwasan ang ganitong trahedya.

asr-001992
02:08:37.770 --> 02:08:43.490
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, alam ko 10 seconds na lang ako pero pagpaumanhin, isang katalungan lamang po para sa marina.

asr-001993
02:08:44.170 --> 02:08:50.830
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa marina, magkano ang naka-allocate po para sa Vessel Safety Inspection for 2027?

asr-001994
02:08:51.490 --> 02:08:56.990
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sapat po ba ito dahil sa dami ng registered vessel nationwide?

asr-001995
02:08:57.590 --> 02:09:01.830
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At kung kulang, ano naman po ang immediate plan ng marina?

asr-001996
02:09:01.930 --> 02:09:03.930
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Para ma-address ang gap na ito.

asr-001997
02:09:06.520 --> 02:09:13.320
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Good morning to all and with the permission of the Chair and the Secretary of Transportation po.

asr-001998
02:09:14.240 --> 02:09:22.140
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: As to the MOOE, we can say so far enough but as we have also manifested in several hearings,

asr-001999
02:09:22.580 --> 02:09:28.640
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: we really need additional personnel to augment and to improve our maritime safety.

asr-002000
02:09:30.980 --> 02:09:33.640
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Another item that we really also...

asr-002001
02:09:33.940 --> 02:09:47.240
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: also needed and we have included in our Tier 2, of course, is the continuing capacity building of our personnel considering these are very technical matters, Mr. Chair.

asr-002002
02:09:48.340 --> 02:09:50.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, just a follow-up po doon.

asr-002003
02:09:50.200 --> 02:09:57.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So ano po yung plano ninyo now that minention ninyo na kulang yung inyong budget po for 2027?

asr-002004
02:09:57.860 --> 02:10:03.860
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: As to the personnel po, we have submitted na under the government approval.

asr-002005
02:10:03.940 --> 02:10:05.320
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: optimization plan.

asr-002006
02:10:05.820 --> 02:10:15.140
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: Our comprehensive proposal for manpower, of course, it will be subjected to the evaluation

asr-002007
02:10:16.100 --> 02:10:24.300
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: by the DBM and eventually, this will be provided to strengthen our regional offices.

asr-002008
02:10:24.780 --> 02:10:33.500
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: For 2027, of course, we are also appealing that other proposal under Tier 2 would be if

asr-002009
02:10:33.940 --> 02:10:39.700
MARINA Administrator Sonia B. Malaluan: it would be considered as well by the Committee on Appropriation, Mr. Chair.

asr-002010
02:10:40.340 --> 02:10:45.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, Mr. Chair. With that, in closing, magbamanifest lang po ako, Mr. Chair.

asr-002011
02:10:45.980 --> 02:10:51.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I hope yung Marina magkaroon din po ng reforms undertaken

asr-002012
02:10:51.220 --> 02:10:56.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: to ensure na walang nakakalusot ng mga vessels na hindi seaworthy

asr-002013
02:10:56.400 --> 02:11:00.500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at hindi na po maulit yung nangyari sa M/V Trisha Kerstin 3.

asr-002014
02:11:00.500 --> 02:11:06.500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, nais ko pong imanifest din na patuloy kong imomonitor

asr-002015
02:11:07.180 --> 02:11:10.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at patuloy pong imomonitor ng Akbayan Reform Block

asr-002016
02:11:10.940 --> 02:11:14.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang performance at budget utilization ng Marina,

asr-002017
02:11:14.840 --> 02:11:20.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: lalo na pagdating sa vessel safety, inspections, at compliance sa international conventions.

asr-002018
02:11:21.460 --> 02:11:25.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Bilang pangunahing ahensya na nag-oversee ng maritime industry,

asr-002019
02:11:25.740 --> 02:11:30.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: tungkulin ng Marina na siguraduhin na wala nang mangyayaring trahedya

asr-002020
02:11:30.480 --> 02:11:33.700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: gaya po ng nangyari sa M/V Trisha Kerstin 3.

asr-002021
02:11:33.820 --> 02:11:35.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-002022
02:11:35.960 --> 02:11:37.800
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you very much, Cong Dada.

asr-002023
02:11:38.520 --> 02:11:43.280
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: And I would like to acknowledge the presence of Representative Chan.

asr-002024
02:11:44.820 --> 02:11:48.960
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: And then next to interpolate is from the City of Golden Friendship,

asr-002025
02:11:49.120 --> 02:11:51.920
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: the most young-looking, Rufus Rodriguez.

asr-002026
02:11:51.920 --> 02:11:58.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much, Co-Chair Ray Arogancia, my confadre, Chair Erwin Ongchuan.

asr-002027
02:12:00.480 --> 02:12:04.440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And my distinguished colleagues, especially the Chairman of the Committee on Transportation,

asr-002028
02:12:04.660 --> 02:12:05.680
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Franz Pumaren.

asr-002029
02:12:06.620 --> 02:12:11.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Mr. Chairman, I heard the opening statement of our dear Secretary,

asr-002030
02:12:12.260 --> 02:12:15.740
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Secretary Lopez, and heard the presentation of [unclear],

asr-002031
02:12:16.400 --> 02:12:18.840
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: and saw that video presentation,

asr-002032
02:12:18.840 --> 02:12:24.600
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: and we can see the outstanding achievements of the Department of Transportation

asr-002033
02:12:24.600 --> 02:12:28.820
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: and the attached agencies on land, on sea, and air.

asr-002034
02:12:29.800 --> 02:12:30.460
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And I remember,

asr-002035
02:12:30.480 --> 02:12:35.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I remember Winston Churchill in 1942 fighting the Nazi Germany.

asr-002036
02:12:36.320 --> 02:12:41.660
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And he said in his address to the Parliament of Great Britain, he said,

asr-002037
02:12:42.360 --> 02:12:48.700
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: we shall fight them on the land, we shall fight them in the sea,

asr-002038
02:12:49.260 --> 02:12:56.260
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: we shall fight them on the air until Nazi Germany will perish from this earth.

asr-002039
02:12:56.260 --> 02:12:59.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: You see, the D.O.T.R.

asr-002040
02:12:59.220 --> 02:13:01.760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Achievements Railway,

asr-002041
02:13:02.640 --> 02:13:05.720
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: bus traffic system, bus transit.

asr-002042
02:13:06.540 --> 02:13:07.840
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: That is land, sea.

asr-002043
02:13:08.480 --> 02:13:11.600
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: You see the ports and everything.

asr-002044
02:13:12.160 --> 02:13:15.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then the D.C.A., our air, the airports.

asr-002045
02:13:15.920 --> 02:13:21.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then, of course, we have here the Philippine Coast Guard fighting it out

asr-002046
02:13:21.400 --> 02:13:25.820
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: that China will never get an inch, as President Marcos has said,

asr-002047
02:13:26.120 --> 02:13:27.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: an inch of Philippine territory.

asr-002048
02:13:28.060 --> 02:13:29.200
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So with that, Mr. Chairman,

asr-002049
02:13:29.220 --> 02:13:32.680
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I am therefore constrained in the proper time

asr-002050
02:13:32.680 --> 02:13:38.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: to move for the approval of the budget of the D.O.T.R.

asr-002051
02:13:38.500 --> 02:13:41.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: plus maraming projects na hindi na-funded.

asr-002052
02:13:42.720 --> 02:13:45.640
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And I'd like to therefore propose to the plenary

asr-002053
02:13:45.640 --> 02:13:48.560
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: that we give additional 30 billion,

asr-002054
02:13:49.440 --> 02:13:50.660
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: or the 300 billion,

asr-002055
02:13:50.800 --> 02:13:54.420
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: so that a lump sum,

asr-002056
02:13:55.040 --> 02:13:57.040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: a lump sum of 30 billion

asr-002057
02:13:57.040 --> 02:14:00.380
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: so that through the leadership of Banoy Lopez,

asr-002058
02:14:00.540 --> 02:14:07.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: we are able to also proceed with the implementation of the other projects

asr-002059
02:14:07.620 --> 02:14:11.040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: as determined by the D.O.T.R. and the attached agencies

asr-002060
02:14:11.040 --> 02:14:13.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: to be very important for the development of the nation.

asr-002061
02:14:14.000 --> 02:14:18.420
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Indeed, the Department of Transportation is a vital cog, Mr. Chairman,

asr-002062
02:14:19.020 --> 02:14:20.440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: in the development of our country

asr-002063
02:14:20.440 --> 02:14:25.560
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: so that we have more economic development, social activity, and mobility.

asr-002064
02:14:26.160 --> 02:14:28.980
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And that is why, on the proper time, I will do that.

asr-002065
02:14:28.980 --> 02:14:30.420
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: But I have some questions.

asr-002066
02:14:30.540 --> 02:14:31.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: To the D.O.T.R.

asr-002067
02:14:32.820 --> 02:14:34.200
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Just three short ones.

asr-002068
02:14:34.320 --> 02:14:34.980
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: First question.

asr-002069
02:14:36.340 --> 02:14:39.420
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Can you explain, because my residents in Cagayan,

asr-002070
02:14:39.540 --> 02:14:40.080
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: my constituents,

asr-002071
02:14:40.820 --> 02:14:42.180
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: are now listening to us,

asr-002072
02:14:42.660 --> 02:14:44.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: what are the steps you have taken

asr-002073
02:14:44.220 --> 02:14:47.420
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: for the Mindanao Railway System 3

asr-002074
02:14:47.420 --> 02:14:51.820
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: from Villanueva, Tagoloan, Misamis Oriental,

asr-002075
02:14:52.560 --> 02:14:53.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: to Cagayan de Oro,

asr-002076
02:14:54.060 --> 02:14:55.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: and then to Lagindingan?

asr-002077
02:14:55.480 --> 02:14:56.880
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Can you tell us, Secretary?

asr-002078
02:14:57.260 --> 02:14:59.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Because we have talked to each other in the consultation.

asr-002079
02:15:00.000 --> 02:15:12.340
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Very good news. I'd like our people of Cagayan de Oro to see you and listen to you on what is the move forward so that we will have the railway in Region 10.

asr-002080
02:15:13.360 --> 02:15:16.840
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: This is the Railway Phase 3. Thank you.

asr-002081
02:15:17.940 --> 02:15:22.140
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you, Mr. Chair. First, we are humbled by your kind words, Your Honor.

asr-002082
02:15:22.140 --> 02:15:35.160
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Para sagutin po ang katanungan, Mr. Chair, tama po kayo. Isa po kayo sa talagang tumutulak sa Mindanao Rail Project natin, hindi lang sa Phase 1, Phase 2, at sinasabi nating Phase 3.

asr-002083
02:15:35.580 --> 02:15:47.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Dahil po sa inyong pagtutulak, at talaga namang importante ito, ang sinabi nga po namin noong una ninyo itong ni-raise sa amin last year ay magsisimula na kami ng aming pre-feasibility.

asr-002084
02:15:48.300 --> 02:15:51.820
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Natapos na po yung pre-feasibility namin ngayon. Papunta po kami sa feasibility study.

asr-002085
02:15:52.140 --> 02:15:59.480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kukuha kami sa pondo ng sinasabi nating PPDMF.

asr-002086
02:16:00.060 --> 02:16:15.520
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Gayon pa man, for the entire Mindanao Rail po, as committed po sa inyo last budget hearing, patuloy pa rin po kami nanliligaw ng magpopondo po dito sa napakalaking proyekto.

asr-002087
02:16:15.520 --> 02:16:22.120
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: As a matter of fact po, next week po, mayroon pong kasama ang ating mahal na Pangulo.

asr-002089
02:16:23.020 --> 02:16:40.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pupunta po kami sa ibang lugar, at isa po ito sa magiging usapin sa gobyernong banyaga para makahanap tayo ng tamang pondo at para matuloy ang Mindanao Rail Project.

asr-002090
02:16:40.100 --> 02:16:41.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And it's about time po.

asr-002091
02:16:41.100 --> 02:16:51.100
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kami po ay nagpapasalamat na mayroon pong katulad ninyo na talagang pinaglalaban, tinatayuan, at hindi nakakalimutan ang mga ganitong proyekto.

asr-002092
02:16:52.140 --> 02:16:57.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you for the commitment, Secretary. Soon you will get foreign funding. I'm sure of that.

asr-002093
02:16:57.580 --> 02:17:07.020
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: You're going with the President, I know the country, and to get specifically funders so that they will fund the Mindanao Railway System 1,

