03:14:44.510 --> 03:14:45.230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: sa jurisdiction

asr-004117
03:14:45.230 --> 03:14:47.810
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: ng local government po.

asr-004118
03:14:47.930 --> 03:14:49.290
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Wala po yan sa LTFRB,

asr-004119
03:14:49.690 --> 03:14:51.170
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: wala din po yan sa LTO.

asr-004120
03:14:51.610 --> 03:14:52.530
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganun pa man po,

asr-004121
03:14:52.530 --> 03:14:53.590
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: we have to,

asr-004122
03:14:53.610 --> 03:14:54.390
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: we have to correlate kasi

asr-004123
03:14:54.390 --> 03:14:56.210
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: the local code

asr-004124
03:14:56.210 --> 03:14:59.230
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: with the EVIDA law also.

asr-004125
03:15:00.000 --> 03:15:07.340
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Magsasabi yan kung kailan yung depende sa weight ng isang trike, kung yan pa'y kailangan rehistro or not.

asr-004126
03:15:07.340 --> 03:15:13.420
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sa masusunod na araw po, your honor, kailangan namin maglabas ng department order.

asr-004127
03:15:13.940 --> 03:15:27.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi sa pananaw po namin, the moment po ginamit siyang e-trike na yan, when it involves passenger, when it involves national highway, kailangan na po ma-regulate yan.

asr-004128
03:15:27.260 --> 03:15:32.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Dapat meron siyang tamang lisensya, ang nagmamaneho po dyan is qualified.

asr-004129
03:15:32.720 --> 03:15:39.480
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ganun din po, the roadworthiness, mas lalo na po kapag ginagamit ito na sabi natin pang publiko ang sasakyan.

asr-004130
03:15:39.800 --> 03:15:44.900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We're going to draft, alam ko meron na po kaming initial draft po dito sa department order na ito.

asr-004131
03:15:45.120 --> 03:15:57.220
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kailangan lang namin ayusin mabuti kasi ito po is a novel case in the sense po na ngayon lang po naglilipa na yung mga ganitong kamalalaking e-trikes na ginagamit na rin po na nasa highway.

asr-004132
03:15:57.260 --> 03:16:03.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Minsan o pag-atit. Kung hindi man pang pasahero, ginagamit pag-atit po ng mga kanilang kamag-anak.

asr-004133
03:16:03.700 --> 03:16:08.260
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Maglalabas po kami ng D.O. at ay re-regulate po namin kung anong tama po na pamamaraan.

asr-004134
03:16:09.100 --> 03:16:26.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes, Mr. Secretary, very specific po sa section 447 that the local governments can only regulate tricycles and grand franchises subject to the guidelines prescribed by the Department of Transportation and Communication.

asr-004135
03:16:26.760 --> 03:16:46.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Palagay ko po panahon na para mag yung mga pupwedeng e-trikes. Sabi nyo nga merong mga specification, may labas nyo yung specification para yung mga hindi susunod sa specification eh medyo maisang tabi na natin.

asr-004136
03:16:46.420 --> 03:16:56.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At yun namang pupwede, mabigyan natin ng registration sa LTO para meron po silang legal basis naman yung local government.

asr-004137
03:16:56.080 --> 03:16:58.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: To grant franchises.

asr-004138
03:16:58.800 --> 03:17:01.660
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po, Mr. Chair. Tama po kayo. We're going to do that.

asr-004139
03:17:01.760 --> 03:17:13.900
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May nagda-draft na daw po, sabi lang sa akin ng road sector natin, na kapag simulan na po silang mag-draft ng ating guidelines, at least for the registration and the driver's license po, no? Pagdating dito paglilisensya.

asr-004140
03:17:13.900 --> 03:17:25.900
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sana po madali natin dahil napakalaki po ng epekto nito, especially sa passenger safety. Alam nyo naman, kung public transport tapos walang franchise, pag na-aksidente, pare-pareho namang mga mayroon.

asr-004141
03:17:26.080 --> 03:17:40.260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At yung driver, pati yung mga sumasakay, napakalaki po. Wali-walang insurance. So yan po yung medyo, palagay ko, dapat bigyan natin ng panahon. Salamat po. Salamat po. Thank you.

asr-004142
03:17:40.260 --> 03:17:41.040
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004143
03:17:41.120 --> 03:17:42.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004144
03:17:42.900 --> 03:17:44.640
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: Thank you very much, Cong Egay Erice.

asr-004145
03:17:44.640 --> 03:17:55.460
Rep. Reynante U. Arrogancia: And next is, after this, after Cong Mark, we will take a break. So, from the majority, Cong Mark Anthony Santos.

asr-004146
03:17:56.080 --> 03:18:01.780
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Magandang tanghali, Secretary Lopez at buong DOTR family.

asr-004147
03:18:03.020 --> 03:18:12.420
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Ayon po sa inyong mga naging pahayag sa media, magkakaroon na po ng Memorandum of Agreement signing sa katapusan ng Agosto sa pagitan ng DOTR,

asr-004148
03:18:12.900 --> 03:18:21.480
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Villar Group, LRTA, LRMC, upang maisulong na ang LRT-1 Cavite Extension Project.

asr-004149
03:18:22.000 --> 03:18:25.820
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Partikular, ang mga istasyon sa Las Piñas, sa Pote.

asr-004150
03:18:26.080 --> 03:18:56.080
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Niyog, sa Cavite. Secretary Lopez, matapos ang napakahabang paghihintay ng ating mga kababayan sa Las Piñas at Cavite, nais ko pong magkaroon ng malinaw na sagot sa mga sumusunod. Number one, natuloy na po ba ang MOA signing na inyong inanunsyo? Kung natuloy, pwede po ba kaming makahingi ang committee ng kopya? Kung hindi po, ano na po ang dahilan ng pagkaantala, Mr. Secretary?

asr-004151
03:18:56.780 --> 03:18:58.020
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004152
03:18:58.220 --> 03:19:00.920
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Paki, sorry, that's okay. Thank you.

asr-004153
03:19:02.360 --> 03:19:03.600
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004154
03:19:04.640 --> 03:19:10.200
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Cong Mark, salamat po at isa kayo sa talagang nagtulak dito sa Las Piñas Station at naantala talaga.

asr-004155
03:19:10.860 --> 03:19:15.500
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At kaya nga po kami, ako po personally, nagulat na ganito kalala yung sitwasyon po.

asr-004156
03:19:16.460 --> 03:19:25.580
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po nag-anunso po ako na within the month of August, I think hanggang September po, makakapirma kami ng MOA.

asr-004157
03:19:26.080 --> 03:19:31.360
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At based on the report po sa akin ngayon, I'm going to defer it to Admin Cup po, no?

asr-004158
03:19:31.700 --> 03:19:34.980
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: May mga, pwede daw sila magpirmahan anytime.

asr-004159
03:19:35.540 --> 03:19:37.940
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Sir, with your permission, sir, at least sa MOA po.

asr-004160
03:19:38.140 --> 03:19:38.460
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Sige po.

asr-004161
03:19:39.240 --> 03:19:43.040
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Mr. Chair, Congressman Mark, maraming salamat po.

asr-004162
03:19:43.880 --> 03:19:48.160
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Nagkaroon po kami ng meeting with senior officials po ng Villar Group last week.

asr-004163
03:19:48.520 --> 03:19:56.060
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: And ni-report po nila na hinaantay na lang po nila yung formal release nung nakasanlang dalawang property.

asr-004164
03:19:56.080 --> 03:20:01.300
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: And with that, we are very, very confident po na ma-release po ito within September.

asr-004165
03:20:02.040 --> 03:20:06.080
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Kaya po, nag-commit na po sila that they're going to sign po yung Memorandum of Agreement.

asr-004166
03:20:06.680 --> 03:20:14.160
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: At naka-integrate na po, naka-integrate na po doon sa Memorandum of Agreement, yung permit to enter on the part of the government.

asr-004167
03:20:14.320 --> 03:20:19.460
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: So ibig sabihin, once kasama po sa provision nung kanilang pipirmahan, anytime po,

asr-004168
03:20:19.460 --> 03:20:24.960
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: na Memorandum of Agreement is a provision stating that after 30 days upon signing,

asr-004169
03:20:24.960 --> 03:20:28.680
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: pwede na po pasukin at gamitin ng gobyerno yung lupa.

asr-004170
03:20:29.380 --> 03:20:31.400
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: So, willing na po sila po nga, anytime po.

asr-004171
03:20:31.600 --> 03:20:36.140
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: At tinatapos lang po namin itong mga budget hearing at saka itong nakaraang habagat,

asr-004172
03:20:36.600 --> 03:20:40.200
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: kaya hindi po namin ma-set kaagad po yung signing activity.

asr-004173
03:20:40.380 --> 03:20:42.620
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: But, yun na po yung current po na situation.

asr-004174
03:20:43.500 --> 03:20:44.100
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Thank you.

asr-004175
03:20:44.100 --> 03:20:50.040
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Mr. Chair, ano-ano po ang mga kondisyon at dokumentong kailangan maisakatuparan

asr-004176
03:20:50.040 --> 03:20:54.620
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: bago tuloy yung ma-turnover ang mga lupang kailangan para sa Las Piñas Station?

asr-004177
03:20:54.960 --> 03:21:04.740
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Mr. Chair, unang-una po yung Memorandum of Agreement na naka-integrate na po yung permit to enter doon sa mga Villar property.

asr-004178
03:21:05.760 --> 03:21:13.060
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: And then, kailangan na rin po namin makakuha ng permit to enter doon sa mga iba pang lupa na kailangan po nung stasyon.

asr-004179
03:21:13.060 --> 03:21:18.260
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: At ito po yung ginagawa na po namin ngayon kasi mga naunang panahon po,

asr-004180
03:21:18.980 --> 03:21:24.160
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: hindi po kami masyadong ini-entertain ng mga lot owners kasi nga po,

asr-004181
03:21:24.160 --> 03:21:28.940
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: wala pang kasiguraduhan kung matutuloy nga po yung donasyon ng Villar Group.

asr-004182
03:21:29.040 --> 03:21:32.040
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: So, ngayong meron na pong kaliwanagan,

asr-004183
03:21:32.620 --> 03:21:36.940
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: willing na po sila na i-entertain po kami at mamadalin po namin na makakuha po kami ng,

asr-004184
03:21:37.280 --> 03:21:39.980
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: matapos po namin yung tinatawag natin ng negotiated procurement

asr-004185
03:21:39.980 --> 03:21:46.940
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: at makakuha kami kaagad po ng permit to enter para maisakatuparan po namin yung kasunod na hakbangin.

asr-004186
03:21:47.680 --> 03:21:52.480
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Ang una po dito is una po, yun nga yung ma-acquire po namin or makapasok kami doon sa property

asr-004187
03:21:52.480 --> 03:21:53.980
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: and then pangalawang step po nito,

asr-004188
03:21:54.160 --> 03:21:58.540
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: is maisagawa po namin yung mga demolition activities kasi may mga structures po doon,

asr-004189
03:21:59.000 --> 03:22:03.040
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: kailangan po natin i-demolish ito para ma-turnover po natin doon sa concessionaire.

asr-004190
03:22:03.900 --> 03:22:09.900
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: At mamadalin po namin lahat po itong mga hakbangin na ito para makabilis po natin yung timeline ng project.

asr-004191
03:22:10.380 --> 03:22:13.300
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Mr. Chair, kung sinasabing resolved na ang right-of-way issue,

asr-004192
03:22:13.760 --> 03:22:18.300
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: maaari po ba ninyong kumpirmahin sa komiting ito na wala nang natitirang legal,

asr-004193
03:22:18.300 --> 03:22:23.880
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: technical, financial or property issues na maaaring muling madelay sa proyekto?

asr-004194
03:22:24.160 --> 03:22:29.040
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Mr. Chair, so far po doon sa naging usapan namin with the Villar Group

asr-004195
03:22:29.040 --> 03:22:34.660
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: and po doon sa report ng PMO, wala na pong technical at financial issues po

asr-004196
03:22:34.660 --> 03:22:40.600
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: na pwedeng humadlang po dito sa usapin tungkol sa lokasyon ng Las Piñas Station.

asr-004197
03:22:40.940 --> 03:22:44.060
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Mr. Chair, yung nakasanla po kasing property, na-resolve na po ba yun?

asr-004198
03:22:44.500 --> 03:22:50.040
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Opo, Mr. Chair, based po doon sa usapan namin with the senior executives po ng Villar Group,

asr-004199
03:22:50.640 --> 03:22:54.060
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: very confident po sila na ma-approve po yung pagkakataon,

asr-004200
03:22:54.160 --> 03:22:55.640
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: naka-release nung dalawang nakasanla.

asr-004201
03:22:55.780 --> 03:22:59.300
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Ang ginawa po nila is nag-offer po sila ng kapalit na property.

asr-004202
03:22:59.900 --> 03:23:02.400
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: At yun po, hinihintay na lang po yung formal approval.

asr-004203
03:23:02.540 --> 03:23:05.080
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Kaya nga po, very, very confident po sila na within September,

asr-004204
03:23:05.660 --> 03:23:07.440
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: ma-re-release na po yung dalawang property na yun.

asr-004205
03:23:07.560 --> 03:23:09.580
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Kaya nga po, willing na po silang pumirma.

asr-004206
03:23:10.500 --> 03:23:12.840
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Anytime po, at upon signing nga po,

asr-004207
03:23:13.400 --> 03:23:16.940
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: naka-integrate na po doon sa memorandum of agreement na after 30 days,

asr-004208
03:23:17.640 --> 03:23:19.400
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: kapirma ng memorandum of agreement,

asr-004209
03:23:19.880 --> 03:23:22.000
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: pwede na po namin pasukin at gamitin po yung property.

asr-004210
03:23:22.840 --> 03:23:23.240
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Mr. Chair,

asr-004211
03:23:24.160 --> 03:23:29.060
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Kailan po eksaktong magsisimula ang aktuwal na konstruksyon sa Las Piñas Station?

asr-004212
03:23:29.700 --> 03:23:33.520
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Hindi po general timeline ang hihingin po natin ay target date.

asr-004213
03:23:33.740 --> 03:23:34.140
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Mr. Chair.

asr-004214
03:23:36.220 --> 03:23:39.660
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Mr. Chair, yung target date po, kailangan po namin i-calibrate.

asr-004215
03:23:39.880 --> 03:23:42.740
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Sabi ko nga po, number one, tapusin lang po na namin yung documentation

asr-004216
03:23:42.740 --> 03:23:45.640
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: ng mga properties na kailangan po natin sa property.

asr-004217
03:23:46.220 --> 03:23:49.860
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Makakuha kami ng formal permit to enter sa mga properties na ito.

asr-004218
03:23:50.520 --> 03:23:53.520
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: And then, umpisan po namin yung demolition.

asr-004219
03:23:53.520 --> 03:23:55.420
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Kailangan po namin i-subject ng procurement.

asr-004220
03:23:55.440 --> 03:24:00.280
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Mr. Chair, if I may, yung estimate niyo po, Las Peñas Station, gano'ng katagal po?

asr-004221
03:24:01.580 --> 03:24:04.540
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Sa estimate po, mga halos mga three years pa po.

asr-004222
03:24:05.060 --> 03:24:08.600
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Isasama na po yung demolition, yung acquisition po,

asr-004223
03:24:09.060 --> 03:24:12.520
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: and then, iti-design pa po ito nung ating concessionaire,

asr-004224
03:24:12.980 --> 03:24:15.840
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: and then, actual po, nagagawin po nila yung station.

asr-004225
03:24:16.040 --> 03:24:20.600
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: We have to remember po, Mr. Chair, na ang gagawa po nito ay yung concessionaire.

asr-004226
03:24:20.600 --> 03:24:23.760
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: So, kukuha pa rin po sila ng designer po nila

asr-004227
03:24:25.440 --> 03:24:27.440
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: yung design nung stasyon at saka yung biodeck.

asr-004228
03:24:27.440 --> 03:24:30.440
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Then, at the same time, kukuha po sila ng kanilang contractor.

asr-004229
03:24:30.440 --> 03:24:32.440
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: So, doon pa lang po, actually, mga kapag umpisa.

asr-004230
03:24:32.440 --> 03:24:36.440
LRTA Administrator Atty. Hernando T. Cabrera: Kaya, we're estimating po, mga, mga, mga, almost mga three years pa po or more.

asr-004231
03:24:36.440 --> 03:24:42.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: To Secretary Lopez, ilang taon na pong naghihintay ang mga commuter ng Las Peñas at Cavite.

asr-004232
03:24:42.440 --> 03:24:47.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Ilang beses na rin pong narinig ng publiko na malapit na ma-resolve.

asr-004233
03:24:47.440 --> 03:24:53.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Magsisimula na ang proyekto. Ngayon po, gusto nating maging malinaw.

asr-004234
03:24:53.440 --> 03:24:55.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Ano ang eksaktong petsa?

asr-004235
03:24:55.440 --> 03:24:57.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Nang pagsisimula ng construction?

asr-004236
03:24:57.440 --> 03:25:03.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At sino po ang mananagot kung muli na namang hindi ito matutupad, Mr. Chair?

asr-004237
03:25:03.440 --> 03:25:05.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Tama po kayo, Your Honor.

asr-004238
03:25:05.440 --> 03:25:10.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kaya patuloy din po ako huhingi sa inyo na patuloy po kayong bantayan kami.

asr-004239
03:25:10.440 --> 03:25:15.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At yung una pong usapan namin dito eh, sana po masimulan na namin makapasok sa property.

asr-004240
03:25:15.440 --> 03:25:19.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Ang target ko sana dito is first week of September.

asr-004241
03:25:19.440 --> 03:25:22.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pero tulad nga po nang sinabi ni Admin Cabrera,

asr-004242
03:25:22.440 --> 03:25:32.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pinapapalitan kasi namin yung mga nakamortgage dito sa Las Piñas para naman protektado ang ating gobyerno.

asr-004243
03:25:32.440 --> 03:25:35.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasama dyan yung unconditional permit to enter.

asr-004244
03:25:35.440 --> 03:25:43.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: So yan naman po ay nakakuha ako ng commitment po sa kanila na hopefully this month matapos na po yung pirmahan.

asr-004245
03:25:43.440 --> 03:25:48.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Right after po ng pagpipirma, sabi ko isama na rin ng LRMC.

asr-004246
03:25:48.440 --> 03:25:50.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kasi ang talaga po magtatayo dito,

asr-004247
03:25:50.440 --> 03:25:54.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: yung sinasabi nating proponent natin, LRMC.

asr-004248
03:25:54.440 --> 03:25:59.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At pumayag naman po sila na masimulan itong Las Peñas Station.

asr-004249
03:25:59.440 --> 03:26:07.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pag meron na silang permit to enter ay sisimulan na nila yung mga earthworks po nila doon sa estasyon na yun.

asr-004250
03:26:07.440 --> 03:26:15.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Mr. Chair, Meron pong 50 families na madi-dislocate or mare-relocate dito.

asr-004251
03:26:15.440 --> 03:26:18.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Ito po ay mga awardees na ng NHA.

asr-004252
03:26:18.440 --> 03:26:24.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At nangangamba po sila na ano po ang mangyayari sa kanila.

asr-004253
03:26:24.440 --> 03:26:27.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Kasi na-relocate na po sila, i-re-relocate na naman po natin.

asr-004254
03:26:27.440 --> 03:26:30.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Ako po willing tumulong sa inyo.

asr-004255
03:26:30.440 --> 03:26:36.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Pero kailangan bigyan po natin sila ng sapat na panahon para makapaghanda.

asr-004256
03:26:36.440 --> 03:26:40.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At kung pwede niyong umpisahan yung mga posted doon sa sukat,

asr-004257
03:26:40.440 --> 03:26:44.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: siguro ihuli muna natin sila at bigyan natin sila ng financial.

asr-004258
03:26:44.440 --> 03:26:47.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Of course na just compensation naman.

asr-004259
03:26:47.440 --> 03:26:53.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At the ARO law dictates that it's a fair market value ng lupa na yan.

asr-004260
03:26:53.440 --> 03:26:56.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At sana pare-pareho na lang.

asr-004261
03:26:56.440 --> 03:27:03.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At tutulong po ako kasi meron po akong budget sa NHA for a socialized housing project.

asr-004262
03:27:03.440 --> 03:27:05.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At hindi ko po pwedeng sabihin sa inyo kung saan.

asr-004263
03:27:05.440 --> 03:27:07.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Pero in-city po ito.

asr-004264
03:27:07.440 --> 03:27:15.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: So, I can sit down with you anytime po, Secretary and LRTA, Tornie Cabrera.

asr-004265
03:27:15.440 --> 03:27:16.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Secretary, ang sinasabi ko po.

asr-004266
03:27:16.440 --> 03:27:22.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Secretary, ang sinasabing solusyon ng right-of-way problem ay may pagdodonate ng lupa.

asr-004267
03:27:22.440 --> 03:27:24.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Kailangan sa Las Piñas Station.

asr-004268
03:27:24.440 --> 03:27:29.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Maaari po bang malinaw na sabihin ng committee na finalized na ang donation?

asr-004269
03:27:29.440 --> 03:27:31.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Pero sinagot niyo na po kanina yan eh.

asr-004270
03:27:31.440 --> 03:27:34.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: So, wala pang pirmahan tayo.

asr-004271
03:27:34.440 --> 03:27:40.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Maaari po bang bigyan natin ang committing ito ng taga Las Piñas at ng isang malinaw na commitment?

asr-004272
03:27:40.440 --> 03:27:44.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Matutuloy na ba talaga ang Las Piñas sa Pote at Nyog Stations?

asr-004273
03:27:44.440 --> 03:27:50.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At kailan natin makikita ng may actual construction sa site?

asr-004274
03:27:50.440 --> 03:27:55.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Secretary, pagod na pagod na po ang aming mga commuter sa mga pangako.

asr-004275
03:27:55.440 --> 03:28:03.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At hinihingi nila ngayon ay hindi pangako, kundi action, timeline, at risulta.

asr-004276
03:28:03.440 --> 03:28:07.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: I fully support the Las Piñas Station.

asr-004277
03:28:07.440 --> 03:28:10.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Salamat po.

asr-004278
03:28:10.440 --> 03:28:12.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004279
03:28:12.440 --> 03:28:15.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Salamat po, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-004280
03:28:15.440 --> 03:28:21.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Makikipag-ugnayan po kami sa inyo, Cong Santos, at kailangan po talaga namin yung tulong

asr-004281
03:28:21.440 --> 03:28:29.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: pagdating po dito sa mga sinasabi nating pamilya, 55 families na nasa tabi po nung Villar property.

asr-004282
03:28:29.440 --> 03:28:36.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At yun din po yung sinabi natin sa LRTA, na unahin po yung Villar property.

asr-004283
03:28:36.440 --> 03:28:40.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Bibigyan po natin ang sapat na panahon, hindi lang po yung sapat na panahon.

asr-004284
03:28:40.440 --> 03:28:45.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Kung anong pang mga financial obligation, under the ARO Act po.

asr-004285
03:28:45.440 --> 03:28:50.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: At magagawa lang po namin ito kung kasama po kayo, Cong Santos.

asr-004286
03:28:50.440 --> 03:28:56.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: Pangalawa po, masasabi ko po talaga na once okay na po itong ating Las Piñas Station,

asr-004287
03:28:56.440 --> 03:29:02.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: by way of formal document, deed of donation, ituloy-tuloy na po ang proyektong ito.

asr-004288
03:29:02.440 --> 03:29:08.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: We commit that po, not only the Las Piñas, kasi kailangan po natin i-address also yung Zapote,

asr-004289
03:29:08.440 --> 03:29:14.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: na wala na pong problema, kaso lang po because of the Las Piñas, nagaantay na rin po sila.

asr-004290
03:29:14.440 --> 03:29:17.440
DOTr Secretary Giovanni Z. Lopez: And all the way po, pagdating po sa Cavite.

asr-004291
03:29:17.440 --> 03:29:20.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Sek, kailangan po yung local government din.

asr-004292
03:29:20.440 --> 03:29:28.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Upuan po natin yung [unclear], yung [unclear], para bigyan naman natin ng assurance yung mga kababayan ko.

asr-004293
03:29:28.440 --> 03:29:32.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Kasi po, pinanganak po sila doon mga 50, 60 years ago na po.

asr-004294
03:29:32.440 --> 03:29:36.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Tagaroon po ako sa lugar e, kaya kilala ko po silang lahat.

asr-004295
03:29:36.440 --> 03:29:38.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Well, anyway, I have your assurance, Sek.

asr-004296
03:29:38.440 --> 03:29:47.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At sana hindi na tayo umabot sa susunod na budget hearing para at least naumpisa na po ang Las Piñas Station.

asr-004297
03:29:47.440 --> 03:29:50.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair and this committee.

asr-004298
03:29:50.440 --> 03:29:55.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At malaking bagay po ito para sa mga taga-Las Piñas. Thank you.

asr-004299
03:29:55.440 --> 03:29:59.440
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Thank you, Cong Mark. We'll have a one-hour lunch break.

asr-004300
03:30:00.720 --> 03:30:02.280
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Kinabahan nyo yung iba, one minute na.

